{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PixelPop 2087</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>the spirit of the 80s</strong> is so powerful it shapes the entire world, <strong>magic and technology collide</strong> in a <strong>post-futuristic 2087</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>action 2D game with rogue-lite inspired mechanics</strong>, where you can <strong>choose between two characters</strong> with completely different combat styles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elly</strong>, a melee fighter who masters close combat weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Johnny</strong>, a gunslinger who relies on firepower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through, collect new weapons, and defeat your enemies...\u00a0 or avoid combat altogether. <strong>Get the keys, unlock new rooms</strong>\u00a0and push deeper into the fortress to rescue your partner. <strong>The choice between action and evasion is yours!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Mage has kidnapped your partner</strong> for the color of their eyes, a crucial ingredient in a forbidden ritual... . To save them, you must <strong>venture into a shifting fortress</strong>, where <strong>every room changes configuration</strong> and danger lurks at every corner. Welcome to <strong><i>PixelPop 2087</i></strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334980?t=1773337399","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773337399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334980/228f6b8c540317429eebaf92ecc7cd293301c082/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773337399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334980/228f6b8c540317429eebaf92ecc7cd293301c082/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773337399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PixelPop 2087</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>the spirit of the 80s</strong> is so powerful it shapes the entire world, <strong>magic and technology collide</strong> in a <strong>post-futuristic 2087</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>action 2D game with rogue-lite inspired mechanics</strong>, where you can <strong>choose between two characters</strong> with completely different combat styles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elly</strong>, a melee fighter who masters close combat weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Johnny</strong>, a gunslinger who relies on firepower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through, collect new weapons, and defeat your enemies...\u00a0 or avoid combat altogether. <strong>Get the keys, unlock new rooms</strong>\u00a0and push deeper into the fortress to rescue your partner. <strong>The choice between action and evasion is yours!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Mage has kidnapped your partner</strong> for the color of their eyes, a crucial ingredient in a forbidden ritual... . To save them, you must <strong>venture into a shifting fortress</strong>, where <strong>every room changes configuration</strong> and danger lurks at every corner. Welcome to <strong><i>PixelPop 2087</i></strong>!</p>","developers":["StylerFunk Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic